ause it's  your performance it's your commitment uh  that that lives on forever  so  uh i have a surprise for you guys i have  a company that i partnered with under  armour and that company is called  project rock  and project rock our training gear  football gear  uh workout gear fitness gear  uh we have become under armour's number  one seller and uh myself project rock  and under armour wanted to give you guys  and gear you up uh the right way before  the game tomorrow  so enjoy your gifts and i'm proud of you  keep up the great work have a great rest  of the season
 

